[ Your Laptop / Phone ]                                [ Amazon's Server ]
          │                                                     │
          │ ─── 1. "Hi Amazon, I want to connect!" ──────────►  │
          │                                                     │
          │ ◄── 2. "Here is my PUBLIC KEY (Locking Key)" ─────  │
          │                                                     │
          │  3. Your laptop invents a temporary password.       │
          │     Locks it with Amazon's Public Key.              │
          │                                                     │
          │ ─── 4. Sends the locked password across internet ─► │
          │                                                     │
          │                                                     │ 5. Amazon unlocks it using
          │                                                     │    its secret PRIVATE KEY.
          ▼                                                     ▼
     Both your laptop and Amazon now share the secret password safely.
     Hackers listening in on the Wi-Fi only saw encrypted nonsense!
